SHORT SILENT VIDEO LOOP
-----------------------

```{=html}
<figure class="media-frame media-frame--landscape">
  <video class="media-frame__asset" muted loop playsinline controls
    poster="images/POSTER.jpg"
    aria-label="[Describe the video and what it demonstrates]">
    <source src="video/FILENAME.webm" type="video/webm">
    <source src="video/FILENAME.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <figcaption class="media-frame__caption">
    [What the reader should watch for.]
    <span class="media-frame__credit">[Video: NAME, if needed.]</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
```

Keep controls available even for loops. Avoid sound on autoplaying video.


